---
layout: page.njk
title: Blog & Articles
permalink: /blog/
navActive: /blog/
eyebrow: 04 — dispatches
headline: blog<br><em>&amp; articles</em>
standfirst: Dispatches on reporting in the Northern Mariana Islands, caring for clients at home, and everything learned in transition.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="postlist">
  {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <article class="postitem">
    <p class="postitem__when"><time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}" title="{{ post.date | dateReadable }}">{{ post.date | timeAgo }}</time></p>
    <div>
      <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="pagefoot">
  <a class="btn" href="/podcasts/">podcasts <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  <a class="backlink" href="/">&larr; back home</a>
</div>
